+# TLS certificate verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is on in all builds, development builds included. This was stated by the project owner in a session and has not been confirmed by a commit or a test, so it is recorded as an unconfirmed statement and not as an enforced rule. Separately, internal hosts are recorded as using plain HTTP, so the verification decision applies to the hosts that still use HTTPS.
